Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.68,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}The sign of the monthly supply change
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.42,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}补给月变化的正负号，描述当前条件下的变化方向。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.68,0:00:04.99,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}shows its direction under current
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.99,0:00:05.76,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}conditions.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.42,0:00:08.65,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}军队换地点、用量或统帅条件
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.76,0:00:09.78,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}It can change with location, usage or commander conditions.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.63,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}变化，这个数也可能变化。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.78,0:00:13.59,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}When an update is allowed, the game adds the applicable
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.63,0:00:16.40,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}实际允许更新时，游戏把当时的变化量加到库存，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.59,0:00:17.47,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}change to stock, then clamps it between zero and current
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.40,0:00:21.17,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}再按零和当前容量截断；不是我们看一眼月变化，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.47,0:00:18.10,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}capacity.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.10,0:00:21.64,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}Reading the monthly figure does not itself apply an
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.17,0:00:25.50,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}就已经加了一次，更不是每天自动除以三十。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.64,0:00:25.31,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}update, and it is not automatically divided by thirty
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.31,0:00:25.94,English,en-9,0,0,0,,{\q2}each day.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.63,Chinese,zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}最后增加多少，仍要重新读实际库存。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.94,0:00:29.69,English,en-10,0,0,0,,{\q2}Read the actual stock again to see how much was gained.
